---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/text.js";
const u = (p = "") => withBase(import.meta.env.BASE_URL, p);
const REPO = "https://github.com/monsieurgregorio2001-coder/slop-editorial";
---
<Base title="Method · Slop Editorial" description="How Slop Editorial is made: a satire built as software, with a pipeline that keeps a human in the loop." page="about">
  <article class="about">
    <p class="sys">Method</p>
    <h1 class="about__h">Generation is cheap. Taste is not.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Slop Editorial is a deadpan satire of AI slop and the attention economy. It targets platforms, metrics, incentives, and the output, never people.</p>

    <h2>Problem</h2>
    <p>AI makes images nearly free, so feeds fill with content nobody decided to make. Hands get six fingers, signs say Sunseet, and every comment says Amazing.</p>
    <h2>Build</h2>
    <p>A static Astro site with scroll-driven staging, a real 3D object with three render tiers, and build gates that enforce voice and speed. Beside it sits a Python pipeline that estimates, caps, approves, and logs every generation.</p>
    <h2>Result</h2>
    <p>The release tracker and the approval queue show the point of the whole thing. Approval happens with a human, not a button.</p>

    <h2>Honesty notes</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Every image is drawn in code. There are no photographs and no image generation services.</li>
      <li>Ratings, ranks, views, and prices are staged and live in this browser only.</li>
      <li>The site sets no cookies and runs no analytics. The cookie sheet is the joke.</li>
      <li>Fonts are self-hosted under the SIL Open Font License. <a href={u("OFL.txt")}>Read the license</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn" href={REPO} rel="noopener">Read the code</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { max-width: 68ch; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 8vh, 96px) var(--gutter) 96px; display: grid; gap: 16px; }
  .about__h { font: 800 clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px)/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .lede { font-size: 20px; }
  h2 { font: 700 22px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: -.02em; margin-top: 20px; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 12px; }
</style>
